      "font" : "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "font size" : 11.04,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
      "content" : "1. Many factors determine your financial aid eligibility. TURNING IN YOUR DOCUMENTS DOES NOT GUARANTEE A FINANCIAL AID   AWARD or DISBURSEMENT DATE!",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 36.001, 568.149, 575.893, 594.622 ],
      "font" : "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "font size" : 9.96,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
      "content" : "2. All disbursement dates are contingent upon funding and subject to change. Grant disbursements are based on your enrollment status and units will be checked approximately 2 weeks before each disbursement date.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 36.001, 505.281, 576.092, 558.149 ],
      "font" : "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "font size" : 9.96,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
      "content" : "3. To receive your full disbursement amount you must be in attendance and your class must have already started. Payment for classes that start after the first day of the semester and payment for classes added late are included with your final disbursement of the semester. If you have applied for a Direct Loan, you will be notified separately of your loan disbursement dates.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 30,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 35.0, 467.0, 333.0, 482.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "under required documents as well as your student email or by phone."
