      "font size" : 9.96,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
      "content" : "10. Cal Grant and Direct Loan Recipients must be enrolled at least half time (6 units) and must have an active academic program (major) other than undecided. See Admissions and Records if updates are necessary.",
